4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nZZeNhtMHU8Q7kNvwFWvVz0&_nc_oc=AdohC9nvHt3AvNKrROXBJaQyLmm18BVLgEh5-yyrclW_o-KVPqQhE4HzKnqProONHXU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0pKXkTorqURh9pn1vaI4F1Cf2kS7YTgarmBL2EZWIj3g&oe=69D500D4"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dtGJ9mKcpXMQ7kNvwHsIUXy&_nc_oc=AdrT3Hq8yLKaHAIl4Poze4H6FzHmEQ0PdjVK48PYXzva3G8LQ4KSDq5-iDwijZEzJP8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3EmBa2fLJ27fML5NwdvV1Xukl7rgxKRTqZ2UBBTfVTNw&oe=69D505B2"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SOSCSNLQbnoQ7kNvwGws04n&_nc_oc=AdrIyoJVt8vu-IPRfm-IWicRAOBFSJwZhegvrYsopxtxSxwnHynkJWVvB4lYetO-X6I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3Jb8hy-cbedtIDIASfuxXBkXFDSuX_QGfT35VeuiwPHg&oe=69D51355"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p